    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634780/extras/5b98d0f039462caa8ff450ba276dde01.avif?t=1747665102\" width=600 height=170 /></span><br><br>Elf World Adventure 7 brings even more captivating puzzles and beautiful elf girls to the popular anime-style erotic series. Dive into brand-new levels, reveal charming illustrations, and set your own pace with Easy or Hard difficulty. Let the gentle music and magical fantasy setting guide your adventure.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634780/extras/264bf14bb0b8b198112182bfc8416c43.avif?t=1747665102\" width=600 height=170 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>New levels featuring elegant elf girls in fantasy clothing<br></li><li>Difficulty selection: Easy and Hard<br></li><li>Steam achievements to customize your profile<br></li><li>Cozy fantasy atmosphere with soft music and lovely artwork<br></li><li>Easy-to-learn controls and accessible gameplay</li></ul>",
